# GitHub Explorer

A full-stack React and Express application for exploring GitHub profiles and repositories.

## Features

- Search GitHub users
- View user profiles with:
  - Avatar image
  - Bio information
  - Top 5 repositories
- View repository details including:
  - Creation date
  - Last update
  - Recent commits

## Technologies

- Frontend: React.js
- Backend: Express.js
- GitHub API

## Installation

1. Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/github-explorer.git
```

2. Install dependencies for both frontend and backend:

```bash
cd github-explorer
npm install
cd client
npm install
cd ../server
npm install
```

3. Run the application:

```bash
cd ..
npm run dev
```

## Testing

Run all tests:

```bash
npm test
```

## Environment

- Node.js v16+
- npm v8+
